### 水务抢修材料验收回放链路 API 示例

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. 查看API根路径
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 3. 工单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/workorders?page=1&pageSize=10

### 4. 创建工单（含材料使用）
POST {{baseUrl}}/workorders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: 张站长

{
  "orderNo": "WO202605240001",
  "siteName": "东城花园A区",
  "siteAddress": "东大街100号",
  "reporter": "李先生",
  "reporterPhone": "13800138000",
  "reportTime": "2026-05-24T23:30:00",
  "dispatchTime": "2026-05-24T23:45:00",
  "repairTeam": "夜间抢修1队",
  "teamLeader": "李队",
  "faultDescription": "夜间管道爆裂漏水",
  "status": "completed",
  "repairContent": "更换DN80管道",
  "completeTime": "2026-05-25T02:00:00",
  "laborCost": 800,
  "materialUsages": [
    {
      "materialCode": "PIPE-002",
      "materialName": "PE管DN80",
      "specification": "DN80,1.0MPa",
      "unit": "米",
      "quantity": 6,
      "unitPrice": 120
    },
    {
      "materialCode": "FIT-001",
      "materialName": "弯头DN50",
      "specification": "90度",
      "unit": "个",
      "quantity": 4,
      "unitPrice": 25
    }
  ]
}

### 5. 查询单个工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/workorders/no/WO202605240001

### 6. 工单变更历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/workorders/{{workOrderId}}/history

### 7. 库存记录列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory?page=1&pageSize=20

### 8. 创建库存记录（出库）
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: 仓管员

{
  "materialCode": "VLV-001",
  "materialName": "DN50闸阀",
  "specification": "DN50,1.6MPa",
  "unit": "个",
  "unitPrice": 280,
  "quantity": 2,
  "operation": "out",
  "operationTime": "2026-05-25T08:00:00",
  "warehouse": "中心仓库",
  "operator": "补录员",
  "workOrderNo": "WO202605240001",
  "remark": "夜间抢修次日补录",
  "isBackfilled": true,
  "backfillTime": "2026-05-25T08:00:00"
}

### 9. 批量补录库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/batch
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: 补录员

{
  "isBackfill": true,
  "records": [
    {
      "materialCode": "PIPE-002",
      "materialName": "PE管DN80",
      "specification": "DN80,1.0MPa",
      "unit": "米",
      "unitPrice": 120,
      "quantity": 6,
      "operation": "out",
      "operationTime": "2026-05-25T08:00:00",
      "warehouse": "中心仓库",
      "workOrderNo": "WO202605240001",
      "remark": "夜间抢修补录"
    },
    {
      "materialCode": "FIT-001",
      "materialName": "弯头DN50",
      "specification": "90度",
      "unit": "个",
      "unitPrice": 25,
      "quantity": 4,
      "operation": "out",
      "operationTime": "2026-05-25T08:00:00",
      "warehouse": "中心仓库",
      "workOrderNo": "WO202605240001",
      "remark": "夜间抢修补录"
    }
  ]
}

### 10. 对账（单个工单）
POST {{baseUrl}}/reconciliation/workorder/WO202605240001
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: 对账员

### 11. 对账历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/reconciliation

### 12. 对账统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/reconciliation/stats/summary

### 13. 异常记录列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/dirty-records?status=pending

### 14. 异常统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/dirty-records/stats

### 15. 回放异常（分析哪些可以自动修复）
POST {{baseUrl}}/dirty-records/replay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dirtyType": "quantity_conflict"
}

### 16. 解决异常记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/dirty-records/{{dirtyRecordId}}/resolve
Content-Type: application/json
X-Operator: 张站长

{
  "resolutionNote": "经核实，现场确实使用5个，补录时少录1个，已修正",
  "correctedData": {
    "quantity": 5,
    "balanceAfter": 15
  }
}

### 17. 审计快照
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/snapshots?targetType=work_order&targetId={{workOrderId}}

### 18. 按操作ID查快照
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/snapshots?operationId={{operationId}}

### 19. 比较两个对象差异
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/diff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "obj1": {
    "materialCode": "VLV-001",
    "quantity": 2,
    "unitPrice": 280
  },
  "obj2": {
    "materialCode": "VLV-001",
    "quantity": 3,
    "unitPrice": 280,
    "remark": "新增备注"
  }
}

### 20. 导出工单报表
POST {{baseUrl}}/export/workorders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderNos": ["WO202605240001"]
}

### 21. 导出库存报表
POST {{baseUrl}}/export/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-31"
}

### 22. 导出对账报表
POST {{baseUrl}}/reconciliation/export
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderNo": "WO202605240001"
}

### 23. 导出异常记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/dirty-records/export
Content-Type: application/json
